{"title":"Elder Matriarch","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 33 Harpy that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/gilded-plume\">Gilded Plume</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder?lv=33\">Lv 33</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>8</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 347 total, 132–215 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×132–215</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"flight-feather\" title=\"Flight Feather - in 2 of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 15 total, 3–12 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e99c04a7b052d79e71e0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Flight Feather</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3–12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-torso\" title=\"Silverhide Torso - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9dc373df2a9348093eb1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-feet\" title=\"Gravewrap Feet - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/cc804dd20cf180ac1c3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gravewrap Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Matriarch&#39;s Roost</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 16</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5105\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-old-matriarch\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/50d7c15d7799aaad4968.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>The Old Matriarch</b><span>Lv 49–58</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Harpy: <a href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy\">Fledgling Harpy</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/harpy\">Harpy</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/harpy-shrieker\">Harpy Shrieker</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/harpy-broodmother\">Harpy Broodmother</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch\">Harpy Matriarch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/f3a9b53f3b950dd9c037.svg\" alt=\"Elder Matriarch\"></div><h3>Elder Matriarch</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>49</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 33)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Harpy</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>290</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>31.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,450</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}